  "slug": "stripe",
  "name": "Stripe",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Stripe development plugin for Claude",
  "longDescription": "Stripe's official plugin combining an MCP server (HTTP to `mcp.stripe.com`) with 2 commands and 1 skill. `/explain-error` provides root cause analysis, actionable fixes, and production-ready code samples for any Stripe error code. `/test-cards` supplies test card numbers for development. The stripe-best-practices skill covers Checkout Sessions, Payment Elements, Connect platforms, subscriptions, PCI compliance, and deprecated API migration.",
